over:scale-[1.02]"/></div><div class="w-full h-full shrink-0 relative"><img src="/img/future-ashray.jpg" alt="सनातन शेल्टर हाउस" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02]"/></div><div class="w-full h-full shrink-0 relative"><img src="/img/future-gurukul.png" alt="सनातन गुरुकुल एवं संस्कार केंद्र" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-[1.02]"/></div></div></div><div class="w-full lg:flex-1 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[460px] sm:min-h-[500px]"><div class="animate-fadeIn"><h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 relative after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:block after:w-10 after:h-1 after:bg-orange-600 after:mt-2 after:rounded-full">सनातन हेल्प सेंटर</h3><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed my-6">सनातन हेल्प सेंटर का उद्देश्य सनातनी समाज के प्रत्येक जरूरतमंद व्यक्ति एवं परिवार को मार्गदर्शन, सहायता एवं सहयोग उपलब्ध कराना है। सामाजिक, कानूनी, प्रशासनिक, दस्तावेजी, रोजगार, स्वास्थ्य एवं अन्य आवश्यक सेवाओं से संबंधित सहायता प्रदान करने का प्रयास किया जाएगा।</p><div class="flex gap-3 mb-6"><a class="bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full shadow-md shadow-orange-600/20 transition-all inline-block text-center" href="/donate">Donate Now</a><button class="bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full shadow-md shadow-orange-600/20 transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-share2 w-4 h-4"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><line x1="8.59" x2="15.42" y1="13.51" y2="17.49"></line><line x1="15.41" x2="8.59" y1="6.51" y2="10.49"></line></svg>Share</button></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 mt-auto"><button class="text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-orange-600 font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer">← Previous</button><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><button aria-label="Go to slide 1" class="h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer w-5 bg-orange-600"></button><button aria-label="Go to slide 2" class="h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer w-1.5 bg-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-400"></button><button aria-label="Go to slide 3" class="h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer w-1.5 bg-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-400"></button><button aria-label="Go to slide 4" class="h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer w-1.5 bg-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-400"></button><button aria-label="Go to slide 5" class="h-1.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer w-1.5 bg-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-400"></button></div><button class="text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-orange-600 font-semibold transition-colors cursor-pointer">Next →</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full flex justify-center p-4 md:p-8 bg-gray-50 border-t border-saffron-100 font-sans"><div class="bg-[#fffdfa] border-2 border-orange-500 rounded-3xl max-w-5xl w-full p-6 md:p-10 text-center shadow-sm"><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 mb-1.5">Long-Term • <span class="text-[#e35300]">Commitment</span></h2><p class="text-[#e35300] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider mb-6">हमारा दीर्घकालिक संकल्प।</p><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-6">“सेवा, सहायता, संस्कार, सुरक्षा एवं आत्मनिर्भरता के माध्यम से एक सशक्त, जागरूक, संगठित एवं आत्मनिर्भर समाज का निर्माण करना हमारा लक्ष्य है।”</h2><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-orange-500 text-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-600 hover:text-white px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md font-semibold text-sm transition-colors mb-4 cursor-pointer"><span>Know More</span><span>▼</span></button></div></section><section class="w-full bg-gray-50 py-16 px-4 border-t border-saffron-100 font-sans"><style>
        @keyframes pulseGlow {
          0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
          50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .glow-green {
          background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #86efac, #10b981, #047857);
          box-shadow: 0 0 12px #10b981, 0 0 20px #10b981;
          animation: pulseGlow 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        .glow-orange {
          background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #fdba74, #f97316, #c2410c);
          box-shadow: 0 0 12px #f97316, 0 0 20px #f97316;
          animation: pulseGlow 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        .glow-blue {
          background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #93c5fd, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
          box-shadow: 0 0 12px #2563eb, 0 0 20px #2563eb;
          animation: pulseGlow 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        /* Continuous Glowing Pulse Animations for the 3 Section Cards */
        @keyframes sectionCardGlowGreen {
          0%, 100% {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35), 0 4px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6);
          }
          50% {
            box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.7), 0 8px 35px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.45);
            border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.95);
          }
        }

        @keyframes sectionCardGlowOrange {
          0%, 100% {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.35), 0 4px 20px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
            border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.6);
          }
          50% {
            box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.7), 0 8px 35px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.45);
            border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.95);
          }
        }

        @keyframes sectionCardGlowBlue {
          0%, 100% {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35), 0 4px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
          }
          50% {
            box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.7), 0 8px 35px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.45);
            border-color: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.95);
          }
        }

        .card-glow-green {
          animation: sectionCardGlowGreen 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;
          border-width: 2px;
        }

        .card-glow-orange {
          animation: sectionCardGlowOrange 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;
          border-width: 2px;
        }

        .card-glow-blue {
          animation: sectionCardGlowBlue 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;
          border-width: 2px;
        }
      </style><div class="text-center mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto"><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 mb-1.5">हमारे अभियान • <span class="text-[#e35300]">हमारी प्रगति</span></h2><p class="text-[#e35300] font-bold text-xs tracking-widest mb-4 uppercase">ACTIVE · WAITING FOR SUPPORT · COMPLETED MISSIONS</p><p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2">A live, paginated view of every initiative — active, awaiting support, or completed.</p></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-start"><div class="bg-[#fffdfa] rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:scale-[1.02] card-glow-green "><div class="p-6 cursor-pointer select-none"><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full inline-block glow-green"></span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-800">Active Missions</h3></div><svg class="w-5 h-5 stroke-[#d9531e] stroke-[2.5] fill-none stroke-linecap-round stroke-linejoin-round transition-transform duration-300 " viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="text-emerald-800 font-bold text-md mt-1">वर्तमान सेवा अभियान</p><p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">ये सत्यापित सेवा अभियान वर्तमान में सक्रिय हैं और लगातार सहयोग प्राप्त कर रहे हैं।</p><div class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-emerald-700 mt-4 uppercase flex items-center gap-1"><span>CLICK TO VIEW</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-[#fffdfa] rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:scale-[1.02] card-glow-orange "><div class="p-6 cursor-pointer select-none"><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full inline-block glow-orange"></span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-orange-600">Waiting for Support</h3></div><svg class="w-5 h-5 stroke-[#d9531e] stroke-[2.5] fill-none stroke-linecap-round stroke-linejoin-round transition-transform duration-300 " viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="text-orange-600 font-bold text-md mt-1">सहयोग की प्रतीक्षा में</p><p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">ये सत्यापित अभियान आवश्यक सहयोग की प्रतीक्षा में हैं। आपका सहयोग इन्हें आगे बढ़ाने में सहायक बनेगा।</p><div class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-orange-600 mt-4 uppercase flex items-center gap-1"><span>CLICK TO VIEW</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-[#fffdfa] rounded-2xl border transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden hover:scale-[1.02] card-glow-blue "><div class="p-6 cursor-pointer select-none"><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full inline-block glow-blue"></span><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-700">Completed Missions</h3></div><svg class="w-5 h-5 stroke-[#d9531e] stroke-[2.5] fill-none stroke-linecap-round stroke-linejoin-round transition-transform duration-300 " viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div><p class="text-blue-700 font-bold text-md mt-1">सफलतापूर्वक पूर्ण अभियान</p><p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">आपके सहयोग से पूर्ण हुए अभियान एवं सेवा प्रयास — समाज में सकारात्मक परिवर्तन का प्रमाण। 🚩</p><div class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-blue-600 mt-4 uppercase flex items-center gap-1"><span>CLICK TO VIEW</span></div></div></div></div><div class="text-center mt-10"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white text-slate-800 border border-slate-700 font-semibold text-sm px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 hover:text-white hover:border-slate-800 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer active:scale-95"><span>View Reports</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="luci