n aria-label="Go to slide 5" class="h-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer w-2 bg-gray-300"></button></div><button class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white border border-gray-300 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700 active:bg-orange-600 active:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer" aria-label="Next slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#241812] via-[#110b08] to-[#0a0604] py-20 px-4 text-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold font-serif tracking-wide text-white mb-2">Why Choose Us</h2><p class="text-[#d49b4b] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[2.5px] mb-16">Built on Trust, Transparency &amp; Service</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><div class="group flex flex-col items-center p-2 cursor-pointer"><div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-[#d49b4b] group-hover:border-[6px] transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out flex items-center justify-center mb-7 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(212,155,75,0.25)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search w-9 h-9 text-[#d49b4b] stroke-[1.8]"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.125rem] font-bold text-white mb-3 min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center leading-snug">Transparency &amp; Accountability</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#bfb8b2] leading-relaxed max-w-[250px] mx-auto">हम संस्था के कार्यों, अभियानों एवं उपलब्ध संसाधनों के उपयोग में पारदर्शिता और उत्तरदायित्व बनाए रखने के लिए प्रतिबद्ध हैं।</p></div><div class="group flex flex-col items-center p-2 cursor-pointer"><div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-[#d49b4b] group-hover:border-[6px] transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out flex items-center justify-center mb-7 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(212,155,75,0.25)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-9 h-9 text-[#d49b4b] stroke-[1.8]"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.125rem] font-bold text-white mb-3 min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center leading-snug">Registered &amp; Verified Organization</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#bfb8b2] leading-relaxed max-w-[250px] mx-auto">Section 8 Company, 12A, 80G, CSR-1 एवं NGO Darpan जैसे महत्वपूर्ण पंजीकरणों के अंतर्गत कार्यरत एक वैधानिक संस्था।</p></div><div class="group flex flex-col items-center p-2 cursor-pointer"><div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-[#d49b4b] group-hover:border-[6px] transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out flex items-center justify-center mb-7 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(212,155,75,0.25)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-9 h-9 text-[#d49b4b] stroke-[1.8]"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.125rem] font-bold text-white mb-3 min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center leading-snug">Safe &amp; Secure Contributions</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#bfb8b2] leading-relaxed max-w-[250px] mx-auto">सभी ऑनलाइन सहयोग राशि अधिकृत एवं सुरक्षित भुगतान माध्यमों के द्वारा स्वीकार की जाती है।</p></div><div class="group flex flex-col items-center p-2 cursor-pointer"><div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-[#d49b4b] group-hover:border-[6px] transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out flex items-center justify-center mb-7 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(212,155,75,0.25)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users w-9 h-9 text-[#d49b4b] stroke-[1.8]"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-serif text-[1.125rem] font-bold text-white mb-3 min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center leading-snug">Dedicated Team &amp; Volunteers</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#bfb8b2] leading-relaxed max-w-[250px] mx-auto">संस्था की टीम, स्वयंसेवक एवं सहयोगी सदस्य सेवा, जागरूकता एवं जनकल्याण के विभिन्न अभियानों में सक्रिय रूप से योगदान देते हैं।</p></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto my-12 p-8 md:p-14 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#121d2b] via-[#17212e] to-[#1e1b19] shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden text-white"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center"><div class="md:col-span-7"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check w-7 h-7 text-green-500 shrink-0 mt-1"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white">Trust &amp; Verification Portal</h2><p class="text-[#d49b4b] text-base md:text-lg font-semibold mt-2">विश्वास के साथ सत्यापन। भरोसे के साथ पुष्टि।</p></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md pl-10 mt-4">Volunteer IDs, member certificates, coordinator postings, donation receipts — every credential issued by us is checkable in real time.</p></div><div class="md:col-span-5 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-7 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg"><form class="space-y-5"><div><label for="docType" class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2">Document Type</label><select id="docType" class="w-full h-12 px-4 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-orange-500 transition-all cursor-pointer [&amp;&gt;option]:bg-[#1a2332] [&amp;&gt;option]:text-white"><option value="Volunteer ID" selected="">Volunteer ID</option><option value="Member Certificate">Member Certificate</option><option value="Coordinator ID">Coordinator ID</option><option value="Donation Receipt">Donation Receipt</option><option value="Appointment Letter">Appointment Letter</option></select></div><div><label for="credential" class="block text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-400 mb-2">Credential Number</label><input id="credential" type="text" placeholder="e.g. SDV-2024-00128" class="w-full h-12 px-4 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-white text-sm placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-orange-500 transition-all" required="" value=""/></div><button type="submit" class="w-full h-12 bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all duration-200 active:scale-[0.99] shadow-md mt-2 cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search w-4 h-4"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><span>Verify Now</span></button></form></div></div></section><div class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#181d26] via-[#0d1015] to-[#08090c] text-white flex flex-col justify-center items-center p-6 font-sans"><header class="text-center mb-12"><h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-3 text-white">Cultural Media Hub</h1><p class="text-[#d99b26] text-xs md:text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase">Sanatan Stories. Streaming Soon.</p></header><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-6xl w-full"><div class="group relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#22262e] to-[#191c22] hover:from-[#2a2f3a] hover:to-[#20242c] border border-white/5 hover:border-[#d99b26]/40 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[#d99b26]/5 flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer"><div><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f3b333] to-[#d08819] flex items-center justify-center text-[#0d1015] mb-8 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-film w-6 h-6 stroke-[2.2]"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 3v18"></path><path d="M3 7.5h4"></path><path d="M3 12h18"></path><path d="M3 16.5h4"></path><path d="M17 3v18"></path><path d="M17 7.5h4"></path><path d="M17 16.5h4"></path></svg></div><h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Films &amp; Documentaries</h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">24 productions</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#f0a92a] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:text-[#f7ba43] transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg><span>Watch trailer</span></div></div><div class="group relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#22262e] to-[#191c22] hover:from-[#2a2f3a] hover:to-[#20242c] border border-white/5 hover:border-[#d99b26]/40 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[#d99b26]/5 flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer"><div><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f3b333] to-[#d08819] flex items-center justify-center text-[#0d1015] mb-8 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-tv w-6 h-6 stroke-[2.2]"><rect width="20" height="15" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><polyline points="17 2 12 7 7 2"></polyline></svg></div><h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Web Series</h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">6 ongoing seasons</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#f0a92a] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:text-[#f7ba43] transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg><span>Watch trailer</span></div></div><div class="group relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#22262e] to-[#191c22] hover:from-[#2a2f3a] hover:to-[#20242c] border border-white/5 hover:border-[#d99b26]/40 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[#d99b26]/5 flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer"><div><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f3b333] to-[#d08819] flex items-center justify-center text-[#0d1015] mb-8 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-music w-6 h-6 stroke-[2.2]"><path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13"></path><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="16" r="3"></circle></svg></div><h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Bhakti &amp; Bhajan</h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">180+ tracks</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#f0a92a] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:text-[#f7ba43] transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg><span>Watch trailer</span></div></div><div class="group relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#22262e] to-[#191c22] hover:from-[#2a2f3a] hover:to-[#20242c] border border-white/5 hover:border-[#d99b26]/40 rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-[#d99b26]/5 flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer"><div><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f3b333] to-[#d08819] flex items-center justify-center text-[#0d1015] mb-8 shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-megaphone w-6 h-6 stroke-[2.2]"><path d="m3 11 18-5v12L3 14v-3z"></path><path d="M11.6 16.8a3 3 0 1 1-5.8-1.6"></path></svg></div><h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white mb-1.5">Cultural Campaigns</h2><p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">12 active initiatives</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#f0a92a] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:text-[#f7ba43] transition-colors"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-play w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"></polygon></svg><span>Watch trailer</span></div></div></div></div><section class="bg-[#faf9f5] min-h-screen py-10 px-6 lg:px-12 flex items-center justify-center font-sans text-gray-800"><div class="max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 items-center"><div class="flex-1 lg:pr-4"><h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 mb-1.5">Monthly Giving • <span class="text-[#e35300]">Daily Support</span></h1><p class="text-[#e35300] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider mb-4">नियमित सेवा, स्थायी प्रभाव।</p><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">नित्य दानी बनकर हमारे सेवा अभियानों को निरंतर सहयोग दें। आपका मासिक सहयोग अन्न सेवा, स्वास्थ्य सहायता, शिक्षा सहायता, गौ सेवा, महिला सहायता एवं अन्य मानव कल्याण कार्यों को निरंतर गति प्रदान करता है।</p><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#fde8db] text-[#e35300] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5 stroke-[3]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>नियमित सहयोग, निरंतर सेवा</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#fde8db] text-[#e35300] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5 stroke-[3]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>80G Tax Benefit (लागू नियमों के अनुसार)</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#fde8db] text-[#e35300] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5 stroke-[3]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>सेवा कार्यों एवं प्रभाव की समय-समय पर जानकारी</li><li class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800"><span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#fde8db] text-[#e35300] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5 stroke-[3]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span>पूर्ण पारदर्शिता एवं जवाबदेही</li></ul></div><div class="flex-[1.4] w-full grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 items-stretch"><div class="bg-white border border-[#ebe6e0] rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm min-h-[290px]"><div><span class="text-[#e35300] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider block mb-1">सेवक</span><div class="flex items-baseline gap-0.5 mb-2"><span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">₹500</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">/ माह</span></div><p class="text-gray-600 text-[12px] leading-snug mb-4">आपका मासिक सहयोग जरूरतमंद लोगों तक सहायता पहुँचाने और सेवा अभियानों को निरंतर रखने में योगदान देता है।</p></div><button class="w-full bg-[#e35300] hover:bg-[#cc4a00] text-white text-xs font-bold py-2.5 rounded-full transition-colors cursor-pointer">Donate</button></div><div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#fff2eb] to-[#ffe3d3] border border-[#ffd1b8] rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm min-h-[290px]"><div><span class="text-[#e35300] text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider block mb-1">सहयोगी</span><div class="flex items-baseline gap-0.5 mb-2"><span class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">₹1100</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">/ माह</span></div><p class="text-gray-600 text-[12px] leading-snug mb-4">आपका मासिक सहयोग अन्न सेवा, शिक्षा सहायता, स्वास्थ्य सहायता एवं गौ सेवा जैसे अनेक मानव कल्याण अभियानों को निरंतर सहयोग प्रदान करने में सहायक होता है।</p></div><button class="w-full bg-[#e35300] hover:bg-[#cc4a00] text-white text-xs font-bold py-2.5 rounded-full transition-colors cursor-pointer">Donate</button></div><div class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#e65100] to-[#8a1005] text-white rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg shadow-orange-600/20 min-h-[290px]"><span class="absolute -top-2.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#ad820a] text-white text-[9px] font-extrabold tracking-wider px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap">MOST CHOSEN</span><div><span class="text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider block mb-1">धर्मवीर</span><div class="flex items-baseline gap-0.5 mb-2"><span class="text-2xl font-extrabold">₹2100</span><span class="text-xs text-white/80">/ माह</span></div><p class="text-gray-100 text-[12px] leading-snug mb-4">गौ सेवा, सनातन संस्कृति संरक्षण, स्वास्थ्य सहायता एवं समाज सेवा के विविध अभियानों को निरंतर सहयोग प्रदान करने हेतु समर्पित मासिक सहयोग।</p></div><button class="w-full bg-[#e35300] hover:bg-opacity-90 text-white border border-white tex