wBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart h-3.5 w-3.5"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path></svg> Go to Full Donation Page &amp; 80G Claim Form →</a></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-[#152232] rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-11 text-white shadow-xl font-sans text-left"><h3 class="text-[#d89b33] text-xs sm:text-sm font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-3">DONOR PROMISE</h3><h2 class="text-xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-7 leading-snug">पारदर्शिता, जवाबदेही और विश्वास हमारी प्राथमिकता है।</h2><ul class="space-y-3.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-100 font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-[#8b5cf6] stroke-[3] flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Donation Receipt ईमेल एवं WhatsApp पर उपलब्ध कराई जाती है।</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-100 font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-[#8b5cf6] stroke-[3] flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>80G Tax Benefit (लागू नियमों के अनुसार)।</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-100 font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-[#8b5cf6] stroke-[3] flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>प्रमुख सेवा कार्यों एवं अभियानों की जानकारी समय-समय पर साझा की जाती है।</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-100 font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check w-5 h-5 text-[#8b5cf6] stroke-[3] flex-shrink-0"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>महत्वपूर्ण रिपोर्ट एवं दस्तावेज उपलब्ध कराए जाते हैं।</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-white border-t border-saffron-100 py-12 sm:py-16"><div class="container-x"><div class="w-full max-w-[1050px] mx-auto py-4 font-sans"><header class="mb-6 text-left"><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 mb-1.5">CSR &amp; • <span class="text-[#e35300]">Partnerships</span></h2><p class="text-[#e35300] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider mb-4">साझेदारी से सेवा, सहयोग से परिवर्तन।</p><p class="deva text-[#615a53] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">CSR, Sponsorship एवं Strategic Partnerships के माध्यम से समाज कल्याण एवं जनहित कार्यों में हमारे साथ जुड़ें।</p></header><div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#3d0c00] via-[#b83a00] to-[#d95300] rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 text-white shadow-md mb-10 text-left"><svg class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-orange-200/90" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M8 12c1-1.5 2-1.5 3 0s2 1.5 3 0 2-1.5 2-1.5"></path></svg><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-2.5">Become a CSR Partner</h2><p class="text-orange-100 text-sm md:text-base max-w-3xl mb-6 leading-relaxed opacity-95">From rural education to gaushala infrastructure — co-design and co-brand programs aligned to your CSR mandate.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap" href="/csr-partner"><svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="3"></rect><rect x="10" y="10" width="4" height="4" rx="1" fill="currentColor"></rect></svg>CSR Partnership</a><a class="border border-white/40 hover:border-white hover:bg-white/10 text-white text-xs md:text-sm font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full transition-all whitespace-nowrap" href="/csr-partner">Become a Partner</a></div></div><div class="text-center text-[0.72rem] font-bold text-[#d95300] uppercase tracking-[2px] mb-7">OUR CSR OUTREACH PARTNERS</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 overflow-hidden py-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-orange-100/60 p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="group relative flex overflow-hidden w-full"><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 z-10 h-full w-16 sm:w-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute right-0 top-0 z-10 h-full w-16 sm:w-24 bg-gradient-to-l from-white to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-6 sm:gap-8 pr-6 sm:pr-8 animate-marquee-left md:group-hover:[animation-play-state:paused]"><div class="flex h-16 sm:h-20 w-36 sm:w-44 shrink-0 items-center justify-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-gray-50/50 border border-gray-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-sm hover:border-orange-200 transition-all duration-300"><img src="/img/tata.jpeg" alt="TATA" loading="lazy" class="max-h-12 sm:max-h-14 max-w-[85%] object-contain transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105"/></div><div class="flex h-16 sm:h-20 w-36 sm:w-44 shrink-0 items-center justify-center p-2 rounded-xl bg-gray-50/50 border border-gray-100 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-sm hover:border-orange-200 transition-all duration-300"><img src="/img/infos