d="m3 11 18-5v12L3 14v-3z"></path><path d="M11.6 16.8a3 3 0 1 1-5.8-1.6"></path></svg><span>REGISTERED MEMBERS ONLY</span></div><h2 class="deva text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4 leading-tight">आधिकारिक सदस्य सूचना केंद्र</h2><p class="deva text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">संगठन की महत्वपूर्ण घोषणाएँ, अभियान निर्देश, बैठक सूचनाएँ, कार्यक्रम अपडेट एवं अन्य आवश्यक जानकारी केवल पंजीकृत सदस्यों के लिए उपलब्ध है।</p><p class="deva text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">यहाँ प्रकाशित सूचनाएँ संगठन की आधिकारिक जानकारी मानी जाएँगी। सभी सदस्यों से अनुरोध है कि समय-समय पर नवीनतम अपडेट एवं घोषणाएँ अवश्य देखें।</p><button class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-orange-500 to-orange-600 hover:from-orange-400 hover:to-orange-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-orange-600/30 hover:shadow-orange-600/50 transition-all duration-200 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock w-4 h-4"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg><span>Login to Access</span></button></div><div class="w-full md:w-80 h-48 md:h-56 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 relative shadow-xl border border-slate-700/50 group bg-slate-900"><img src="/img/members_only.jpeg" alt="Registered Members Only Notice" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"/></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#fdfbf7] py-16 px-4 font-sans text-neutral-800 border-t border-[#efeae4] overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center"><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 mb-1.5">Community • <span class="text-[#e35300]">Voices</span></h2><p class="text-[#e35300] font-bold text-xs tracking-widest mb-12 uppercase">REAL STORIES FROM DONORS, VOLUNTEERS &amp; FAMILIES</p><div class="relative group"><button class="absolute -left-3 md:-left-5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-11 h-11 bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-700 shadow-md hover:bg-[#ea580c] hover:text-white hover:border-[#ea580c] active:scale-95 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer touch-manipulation" aria-label="Previous"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden py-6 px-2"><div class="flex gap-6 will-change-transform" style="transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0);transition:none;backface-visibility:hidden;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden"><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">यहाँ transparency और dedication साफ़ दिखाई देती है। यहाँ सेवा भावना साफ दिखाई देती है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">अ</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">अमित शर्मा</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Dehradun, Uttarakhand</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Help Center, Seva Network और भविष्य की आपातकालीन सहायता जैसी योजनाएँ यदि सफलतापूर्वक आगे बढ़ती हैं, तो यह समाज के लिए बहुत बड़ा योगदान साबित हो सकती हैं।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">न</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">नितिन कुलकर्णी</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Pune, Maharashtra</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Foundation के साथ जुड़कर मुझे लगा कि समाज के लिए कुछ अच्छा करने का यह सही मंच है। यहाँ हर छोटा सहयोग भी महत्वपूर्ण माना जाता है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">र</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">रचना सिंह</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Patna, Bihar</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">सनातन संस्कृति, भजन, और समाज सेवा के माध्यम से समाज में सकारात्मक बदलाव लाना सराहनीय है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">द</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">देवेंद्र जोशी</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Ujjain, Madhya Pradesh</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">बच्चों की शिक्षा और स्वास्थ्य को लेकर संस्था द्वारा किए जा रहे प्रयास वास्तव में अनुकरणीय हैं।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">स</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">सुनीता वर्मा</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">आपदा के समय तुरंत सहायता पहुँचाना इस टीम की सबसे बड़ी खासियत है। मुझे गर्व है कि मैं इनसे जुड़ा हूँ।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">र</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">राजीव मेहरा</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Jaipur, Rajasthan</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">पारदर्शिता और निष्ठा के साथ काम करने वाला यह एक अद्भुत संगठन है। हर दान सही जगह पहुँचता है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">प</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">प्रिया देशपांडे</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Nagpur, Maharashtra</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">युवाओं को समाज कल्याण के कार्यों से जोड़ना और उनमें सेवा भाव जगाना एक बेहतरीन पहल है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">अ</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">अजय चौहान</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Ahmedabad, Gujarat</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">हमारी पूरी सोसाइटी हर महीने इस संस्था को सहयोग देती है। इनका काम वास्तव में धरातल पर दिखता है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">स</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">संजय गुप्ता</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">गरीब परिवारों को आत्मनिर्भर बनाने के लिए चलाए जा रहे वोकेशनल कोर्स बहुत ही असरदार हैं।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">म</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">मीनाक्षी राव</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Bengaluru, Karnataka</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">वृद्ध आश्रमों में भोजन और मेडिकल सहायता उपलब्ध कराना एक बहुत ही पवित्र कार्य है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">व</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">विशाल पांडे</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">साफ़ नियत और स्पष्ट विज़न के साथ काम करने वाली यह संस्था समाज का ताना-बाना मजबूत कर रही है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">क</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">कविता पाटिल</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Nashik, Maharashtra</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">मेडिकल कैंप्स के जरिए दूर-दराज के गाँवों तक स्वास्थ्य सेवाएँ पहुँचाना एक क्रांतिकारी कदम है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">ड</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">डॉ. अलका भट्ट</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Shimla, Himachal Pradesh</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">वालंटियर के रूप में काम करते हुए मुझे जो आत्मसंतोष मिला है, उसे शब्दों में बयां नहीं किया जा सकता।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">र</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">रोहन खन्ना</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Delhi NCR</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex-none w-full sm:w-[calc(50%-12px)] lg:w-[calc(33.333%-16px)] bg-white border border-[#efeae4] rounded-2xl p-7 text-left flex flex-col justify-between transition-transform duration-300 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#ea580c]/10 hover:border-[#fbd6c6] cursor-pointer select-none"><div><div class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-[#ea580c] leading-none mb-3">“</div><p class="text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">ईमानदारी और समर्पण का दूसरा नाम है यह संस्था। समाज के हर वर्ग को साथ लेकर चलना इनकी ताकत है।</p></div><div><div class="h-[1px] bg-[#f1ebe5] mb-5"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ea580c] to-[#f97316] text-white font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">म</div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-neutral-900">मनोज जोशी</h4><p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-0.5">Indore, Madhya Pradesh</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><button class="absolute -right-3 md:-right-5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 w-11 h-11 bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-700 shadow-md hover:bg-[#ea580c] hover:text-white hover:border-[#ea580c] active:scale-95 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer touch-manipulation" aria-label="Next"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></section><div class="w-full bg-[#faf8f5] py-16 px-4 flex justify-center items-start border-t border-[#eae7e1]"><div class="w-full max-w-[720px] mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.05] text-gray-900 mb-1.5">Frequently Asked • <span class="text-[#e35300]">Questions</span></h2><p class="text-[#e35300] font-bold text-xs tracking-wider mb-4">सामान्यतः पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न।</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-[#eae7e1] overflow-hidden"><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">क्या यह NGO केवल सनातन समाज के लिए कार्य करता है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">क्या यह NGO Government Registered एवं Verified है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">NGO से जुड़ने के लिए कोई पात्रता (Eligibility) आवश्यक होती है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">NGO से जुड़ने के लिए कोई शुल्क भी देना पड़ता है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">क्या मैं गुप्त (Anonymous) सहयोग कर सकता हूँ?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">NGO किन-किन प्रकार की सहायता एवं सेवाओं से जुड़ा है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">Sanatani Sena, Vigilance Department एवं Sanatan Seva Network क्या हैं?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">क्या कॉर्पोरेट कंपनियाँ (CSR) भी संस्था के अभियानों में सहयोग कर सकती हैं?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">क्या संस्था द्वारा उत्कृष्ट कार्य करने वाले सदस्यों को सम्मानित किया जाता है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 border-b border-[#f0ede6]"><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">क्या संस्था में कोई पद या जिम्मेदारी प्राप्त की जा सकती है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class="transition-colors duration-200 "><button class="w-full py-5 px-6 flex justify-between items-center text-left focus:outline-none cursor-pointer"><span class="font-bold text-base md:text-[17px] leading-snug pr-4 transition-colors text-gray-900">क्या संस्था द्वारा Appointment Letter, Certificate या ID Card प्रदान किया जाता है?</span><svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-gray-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></button></div></div></div></div><section class="container-x my-20"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-saffron-600 via-saffron-500 to-maroon-600 px-6 py-14 text-center text-white shadow-xl sm:px-12"><div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-2xl"></div><div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-10 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-2xl"></div><p class="deva eyebrow text-saffron-100">आपका सहयोग किसी के जीवन में नई उम्मीद ला सकता है</p><h2 class="deva mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">सेवा, सहयोग एवं सहभागिता के माध्यम से जुड़ें</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm text-white/90">Be part of positive change. Your contribution brings hope, support and dignity to lives across India.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold text-white rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-[0.97] whitespace-nowrap select-none h-[52px] px-7 text-[15px] gap-2" style="background-color:#FF9933;--btn-hover:#e37d17" href="/donate"><span class="shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path></svg></span>Donate Now</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold text-white rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-[0.97] whitespace-nowrap select-none h-[52px] px-7 text-[15px] gap-2" style="background-color:#1E3A8A;--btn-hover:#021e6e" href="/membership"><span class="shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></span>Join the Mission</a></div></div></section><section class="container-x my-20"><div class="card overflow-hidden p-0"><div class="grid gap-0 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-saffron-500 via-saffron-600 to-saffron-700 p-8 text-white sm:p-10"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Newsletter</div><h3 class="deva mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">सेवा, संस्कार और समाज से जुड़े रहें</h3><p class="deva mt-3 text-sm text-white/85">सनातन पर्व, सेवा अभियान, विशेष कार्यक्रमों एवं महत्वपूर्ण अपडेट्स की जानकारी प्राप्त करने के लिए Subscribe करें।</p></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-8 sm:p-10"><form class="space-y-4"><div><label class="field-label">Email Address</label><div class="relative"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-saffron-400"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg><input type="email" required="" placeholder="you@example.com" class="field pl-10" value=""/></div></div><button type="submit" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold text-white rounded-full shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-[0.97] whitespace-nowrap select-none h-[52px] px-7 text-[15px] gap-2 w-full" style="background-color:#16A34A;--btn-hover:#00872e"><span class="shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg></span>Subscribe Now</button><p class="text-center text-xs text-ink/50">We respect your privacy. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></form></div></div></div></section></main></main><footer class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff8c00] via-[#ff6200] to-[#e65100] text-white pt-12"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 pb-10"><div class="md:col-span-6 pr-0 md:pr-8"><a class="inline-block mb-5" href="/"><img src="/img/logo.jpeg" alt="Sanatan Dharm Manav Kalyan Foundation" class="h-16 object-contain mix-blend-multiply"/></a><p class="text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/95">सनातन धर्म NGO एक Professionally Managed सामाजिक एवं सेवा संगठन है, जो भारतभर में सनातन संस्कृति, मानव सेवा और सामाजिक उत्थान के लिए समर्पित है। हमारा उद्देश्य गौ सेवा, शिक्षा सहायता, स्वास्थ्य सेवा, महिला सशक्तिकरण एवं सांस्कृतिक जागरण के माध्यम से जरूरतमंद लोगों के जीवन में सकारात्मक परिवर्तन लाना है। हमारी सभी पहल Structured, Transparent और समाजहित के मूल्यों पर आधारित हैं।</p></div><div class="md:col-span-3"><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-white relative inline-block mb-4 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:absolute after:left-0 after:-bottom-1.5 after:w-9 after:h-[2px] after:bg-white/60">Get Involved</h3><ul class="space-y-3 mt-4 text-[15px]"><li><a class="text-white/90 hover:text-white hover:underline transition-all" href="/donate">Donate Now</a></li><li><a class="text-white/90 hover:text-white hover:underline transition-all" href="/membership">Become a Volunteer</a></li><li><a class="text-white/90 hover:text-white hover:underline transition-all font-semibold" href="/need-help">Need Help (सहायता कें